attempts.description:
Attempts counts calls that could not cast a vote (judge unavailable);
the re-judge worker stops retrying at its MaxAttempts and the run's
deadline escalates it. A token cap or an unusable key is not counted.

state.description:
State is judged (a call was made and read), skipped (nothing was sent;
Reason says why) or unavailable (the call failed; the row was stored
plainly with review=false).

merge_data.description:
MergeData true shallow-merges Data into the stored object (jsonb ||);
false replaces it wholesale. Explicit because silently picking one is how
an agent loses a payload it assumed was preserved.

